      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name} I let the devs know and linked them to your guide.  It does seem like HIG is forwarding unnecessary data. \n\nI do wonder if this will become a bigger problem when more gloves that have the hardware to warrant using VRSkeletalTracking_Full start hitting the market though.  Many of them are opting to include physical inputs, and those being ignored in favor of VRC's gesture system with no way to completely disable it could be a major source of friction for users.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
